    tests_executed=False,runtime_acceptance=False,operational_authority=False)
once(OWN/'SOURCE_CONTRACT_001.json',wire(contract))

handoff='''Utility010 isolated regressions: Source-only preparation

Seven declared Source controls; six runnable methods and one explicitly deferred constructor004 prerequisite. Planned seven parent IDs, ten subtests and24 hypothetical fixture events (7start/6success/1skip/10subtest). These are static plans, not results. All tests remain UNRUN.

Full physical_provenance uses actual selected utility010 bytes and its real bounded reader, private regular files and delegating read/open spies. Both capture_before and whole_before_result receive healthy→one exact causal negative→restored controls. Pipeline006 refuses before open; absent trust002 never falls back to001; authenticated INIT001 refuses before INIT open; nested and unknown placeholders reach their exact intended guards after six reads. Synthetic P16-derived argv retains all8 roles/11 placeholders/6names as inert data. Synthetic logical Root records/PID17/nonces/trace flags never represent real Root producer/OS/tool identity. Detail15/Trace13 shape is complete; unused source_closure/check fields do not establish machine_core acceptance.

Whole-Module and protected multiline controls are inert Source AST/token proofs, separately classified from helper runtime. U8F1 remains deferred because constructor004/table002/complete selected actual model are unavailable in this selected cohort. Do not replace it with a length-only stand-in or count the skip as a cap PASS.

Future loader authenticates81410 bytes/SHA/raw9/API8 before compiling the same bytes in a non-main module namespace. No author compile/import/exec/main/test happened. Source bundle needs a different full Source review followed by separately bounded runtime approval before any loader/test execution. No Root nominal authority path is written: all generated fixtures live inside private TemporaryDirectory and are removed on outcome. No publisher, PowerShell, process spawn, bindings, actual models, READY, pool20, capture/current24 or native/science authority supplied. Caps and600/both90/resource60/510/450+after60 unchanged.

Frozen inputs include genuine U010 review846d/details8f721/post1e48, seven plans, utility007/008/010 and untouched composer, Rootchoice004 and P16. All41+17+24 historical author payloads were read/hashed before and after this own metadata freeze; selected15 originals have triple raw9/API8/hash observations, exact independent copies and post-read. See SOURCE_CONTRACT_001.json, PLANNED_TEST_PACKET_001.json and AUTHOR_FROZEN_SOURCE_MANIFEST_001.json.
'''
once(OWN/'HANDOFF_UTILITY010_REGRESSIONS_001.md',handoff.encode('utf8'))
